From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 13:25:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] sepolicy: allow init to swapon zram0 (nikel zRAM swap)

init.zram.rc (device tree) sets /sys/block/zram0/disksize and runs
mkswap+swapon on /dev/block/zram0, which carries the ram_device label.
Give init rw_file_perms on it; the disksize write is already covered
by the existing "allow init sysfs_type:file w_file_perms".

---
diff --git a/init.te b/init.te
index 9bc78d1..1296c02 100644
--- a/init.te
+++ b/init.te
@@ -162,9 +162,12 @@ allow init self:capability sys_boot;
 allow init sysfs_type:dir r_dir_perms;
 allow init sysfs_type:file w_file_perms;
 
-# disksize
+# disksize (write sudah tercakup oleh allow init sysfs_type:file w_file_perms)
 allow init sysfs_zram:file getattr;
 
+# zRAM swap: mkswap + swapon /dev/block/zram0 (device tree nikel)
+allow init ram_device:blk_file rw_file_perms;
+
 # Transitions to seclabel processes in init.rc
 domain_trans(init, rootfs, adbd)
 domain_trans(init, rootfs, healthd)
